---
---
<section class="py-24 px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white font-heading tracking-tight mb-4">Nos Tarifs Revendeur : Achetez vos Codes IPTV en Gros</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 font-body max-w-3xl mx-auto">Choisissez le forfait adapté à vos ambitions. Aucun abonnement mensuel pour le panel : vous ne payez que les crédits que vous vendez.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Pack Starter -->
        <article class="bg-carbon/40 rounded-[12px] border border-white/10 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-md bg-white/5">
            <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-heading mb-2">Pack Starter</h3>
                <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-white font-heading mb-4">140 €</div>
                <ul class="text-gray-400 font-body space-y-2 mb-8">
                    <li>• 10 Crédits</li>
                    <li>• 14€/crédit</li>
                    <li>• Panel Inclus</li>
                    <li>• Tests illimités</li>
                    <li>• Support 7j/7</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <button class="w-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-body font-medium hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">Commander le Starter</button>
        </article>
        
        <!-- Pack Pro -->
        <article class="bg-carbon/40 rounded-[12px] border border-indigo/50 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-md bg-white/5 transform md:-translate-y-4 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(99,102,241,0.2)]">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-indigo text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-bl-lg">Le Plus Populaire</div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-heading mb-2">Pack Pro</h3>
                <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-white font-heading mb-4">600 €</div>
                <ul class="text-gray-400 font-body space-y-2 mb-8">
                    <li>• 50 Crédits</li>
                    <li>• 12€/crédit</li>
                    <li>• Sous-revendeurs</li>
                    <li>• Panel Inclus</li>
                    <li>• Tests illimités</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <button class="w-full bg-indigo text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-body font-medium hover:bg-indigo/90 transition-colors">Devenir Pro</button>
        </article>
        
        <!-- Pack VIP -->
        <article class="bg-carbon/40 rounded-[12px] border border-white/10 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-md bg-white/5">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-emerald text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-bl-lg">Marque Blanche</div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-heading mb-2">Pack VIP</h3>
                <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-white font-heading mb-4">1000 €</div>
                <ul class="text-gray-400 font-body space-y-2 mb-8">
                    <li>• 100 Crédits</li>
                    <li>• 10€/crédit</li>
                    <li>• URL DNS Personnalisée</li>
                    <li>• Sous-revendeurs</li>
                    <li>• Panel Inclus</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <button class="w-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-body font-medium hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">Commander le VIP</button>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>
